<title>BANGLADESH: Chittagong port handles 12,619 tonnes of cargo.</title>
<headline>Chittagong port handles 12,619 tonnes of cargo.</headline>
<dateline>CHITTAGONG, Bangladesh 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chittagong port handled 12,619 tonnes of export and import cargo in the 24 hours ending 1.00 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Wednesday compared with 16,990 tonnes in the same period on Tuesday, port officials said.</p>
<p>Cargo handling in tonnes:</p>
<p>    Wednesday	     Tuesday</p>
<p>    Export cargo		   3,117		   1,925</p>
<p>    Import cargo		   9,502		  15,065</p>
<p>Berthing schedule of major vessels unloading or expected to unload at Chittagong port:</p>
<p>    Commodity	   Tonnes     Ship	     Berthing</p>
<p>    Cement		20,472     An Da	    15/10</p>
<p>    Sugar		 13,772     Tasmia	   20/10</p>
<p>    Wheat		 25,000     Kea		21/10</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom 880-2-506363</p>
</text>
